OL,3,AControversial Drumcree Orange Order
OL,4,Amarch delayed as protesters block road
OL,5,
OL,6,FA controversial parade organised by
OL,7,FNorthern Ireland's Orange Order is due
OL,8,Fto go down the mainly nationalist
OL,9,FGarvaghy Road later this morning for
OL,10,Fthe first time in almost 30 years
OL,12,FHowever hundreds of protesters,
OL,13,Fincluding Northern Ireland First
OL,14,FMinister Michelle O'Neill and other
OL,15,Fnationalist politicians, have blocked
OL,16,Fthe road
OL,18,FThe parade was due to begin at 08:00
OL,19,FBST but Orangemen, who have gathered at
OL,20,FDrumcree Church to begin their march,
OL,21,Fsay they will wait until the road is
OL,22,Fclear
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
